#. module: sn_wsd_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_stock.field_stock_warehouse__sn_unstored_return_type_id
msgid ""
"Operation type used to return goods to the vendor before they are stored, "
"i.e. before the internal batches are generated."
msgstr "用于在货物入库前（即内部批次生成前）退回供应商的作业类型。"

#. module: sn_wsd_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sn_wsd_stock.field_stock_warehouse__sn_unstored_return_type_id
msgid ""
"Operation type used to return received goods to the vendor, either "
"before they are stored (no batch yet) or after (the stored batch is "
"reused)."
msgstr "用于将已收货货物退回供应商的作业类型：可在入库前（尚无批次）或入库后（沿用已入库批次）使用。"

